Modifications relative to the original project
----------------------------------------------
- The WPF desktop client was replaced by an Avalonia UI (src/ModShardLauncher.GUI).
- The code base was split into three projects: shared domain logic in a UI-free library
  (src/ModShardLauncher.Core), the desktop client and a headless CLI
  (src/ModShardLauncher.CLI). Mods, mod sources, logs and settings moved to the
  per-user data folder (%LOCALAPPDATA%\ModShardLauncher).
- The script console, its network listener and the associated GML injection were removed.
  The public members that already published .sml packages bind to are kept as obsolete
  placeholders so old mods keep loading (see README, "兼容占位").
- Behavioural fixes and additions: cancelable patch pipeline, refusal to patch an
  already-patched file, per-data-file decompiler cache, log folder retention, patch
  timings, and .resx based localization (English, Simplified Chinese, Russian).
- The modding API namespace, type names, method signatures, the .sml package format and
  the Core assembly identity (ModShardLauncher, AssemblyVersion 1.0.0.0) are unchanged.

